<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.90 /10.80  11.40 /11.30   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.00 /10.875 11.20 /11.00   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.00 /10.875 11.25 /11.15   11.70 /11.55</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.00 /10.75  11.25 /11.10   11.75 /11.45</p>
<p>PNB			10.80 /10.70  11.05 /10.90   11.475/11.30</p>
<p>Solidbank		11.00 /10.90  11.20 /11.10   11.65 / 11.55</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.00 /10.80  11.40 /11.20   11.80 /11.40</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
